  "description": "Ultra-clean, high-performance dependency injection extensions for .NET. Enables 1-line Program.cs container registration, declarative attributes ([Scoped], [Singleton], [Transient]), automatic interface discovery, keyed services, modular architecture, and unified Dixor ecosystem DI integration.",
