  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0 (Initial Release)\n\n\t\t\t• Declarative service lifetime attributes ([Singleton], [Scoped], [Transient]) for automatic discovery and registration.\n\t\t\t• Automatic assembly and namespace scanning with interface matching conventions.\n\t\t\t• Full integration with .NET 8+ keyed dependency injection ([KeyedService], [FromKeyedServices]).\n\t\t\t• Extensible modular architecture via IDixorModule for domain-driven multi-project configurations.\n\t\t\t• Thread-safe ambient context flow without constructor pollution across deep call stacks.\n\t\t\t• External configuration-driven service overrides via JSON and XML definitions.\n\t\t\t• Unified ecosystem 1-line root bootstrap via builder.Services.AddDixor().",
